0..79 Comment "// A call written where a value is read runs, and a pure one whose value a type"
80..157 Comment "// after it reads stands there as what it returns: a dependent record\'s first"
158..231 Comment "// component under the second\'s type, and a dependent function\'s argument"
232..302 Comment "// under the parameters after it. A parameter function under `Path.ap`"
303..372 Comment "// answers at its own span. The records are the HoTT book\'s dependent"
373..444 Comment "// pairs (§ 1.6), and the maps out of the circle follow cubical Agda\'s"
445..501 Comment "// `IsoFunSpaceS¹` (`Cubical/HITs/S1/Properties.agda`)."
502..504 Comment "//"
505..558 Comment "// - see: #426 — `toLoopThroughImage`, `fromRecord`"
559..573 Comment "// - see: #443"
